7e23270d-2232-4e79-aaee-a49e3a607334	0d1efd7d-a643-5031-8ab9-169650ef84f1	CONSTITUTIONAL_LAW	80	IDENTITY LAW	\n            IDENTITY LAW\n            \n            Identity is determined by event lineage.\n            Objects have immutable identity from creation.\n            Lineage chains are immutable and append-only.\n            Identity reconstruction is guaranteed by replay.\n            	CANONICAL_SPEC	\N	769eae16645940b98adfb8ebc4115f8ccffe8b7e80a03fb7c31a90bab84e7469	2026-06-24 21:36:08.259468+00	\N	constitutional_ingestion	\N	active
9f89f3f7-f182-4d2c-a788-4bd8a72374d0	378801e7-260d-5002-b26f-6ad6c3741198	CONSTITUTIONAL_LAW	85	MEMORY LAW	\n            MEMORY LAW\n            \n            Memory authority = Replay.\n            Memory is not stored in Qdrant.\n            Memory is not stored in Ollama.\n            Memory is not stored in Open WebUI.\n            Memory is reconstructed from PostgreSQL events.\n            	CANONICAL_SPEC	\N	e938bb7b95155290d272a2b9d350f7dcd69abd43f3b0c27d3a27e329ac54ac43	2026-06-24 21:36:08.745585+00	\N	constitutional_ingestion	\N	active
bbcde989-7757-4d4b-823c-1eddece45433	df2842a8-f13d-583e-89b1-0cec90edd604	CONSTITUTIONAL_LAW	85	INFRASTRUCTURE LAW	\n            INFRASTRUCTURE LAW\n            \n            All external dependencies must be non-authoritative.\n            All credentials must be identified and managed.\n            All services must be recoverable.\n            All services must be replaceable.\n            Infrastructure must be minimal and verifiable.\n            	CANONICAL_SPEC	\N	88585ddcec051eb08ac3f5d5cc165c8b42da7e749ab485e19819158c6c9de616	2026-06-24 21:36:08.927459+00	\N	constitutional_ingestion	\N	active
